hot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-ml3hv5","name":"NVIDIA Technical Blog：Agentic AI / Generative AI","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-10T17:50:26.335Z"}],"sectionLabel":"产品发布/更新","reportSummary":"NVIDIA 推出 NVIDIA Open Agent Safety Platform，包含开源运行时 OpenShell、硬件层 Sentry 及 DOCA 技术。该平台旨在通过内核级隔离、零信任环境和带外（out-of-band）监控来防止 AI 智能体行为漂移和越权。OpenShell 将操作指令转化为可验证策略，BlueField DPU 在模型路径上提供实时策略执行与身份治理，确保即使主机不可信时也能独立保护系统。","reportEdition":"2026-09-28","reportKind":"weekly"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/nhob7mih29e0owj7ay28t7fvw","title":"FTC 以消费者保护为由对 OpenAI、Anthropic 等 AI 实验室启动全面调查","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-09-30T16:20:04.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/nhob7mih29e0owj7ay28t7fvw","https://the-decoder.com/ftc-launches-sweeping-probe-into-openai-anthropic-and-other-ai-labs-over-consumer-protection-concerns"],"articles":[{"id":"nhob7mih29e0owj7ay28t7fvw","title":"FTC 以消费者保护为由对 OpenAI、Anthropic 等 AI 实验室启动全面调查","originalTitle":"","summary":"FTC 正以潜在消费者保护违规为由调查 OpenAI、Anthropic 等头部 AI 实验室，主席 Andrew Ferguson 计划通过具法律约束力的 Civil Investigative Demands 强制调取文件并质询高管，命令将在数周内发出，METR 也在审查范围之列。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/nhob7mih29e0owj7ay28t7fvw","originalUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/ftc-launches-sweeping-probe-into-openai-anthropic-and-other-ai-labs-over-consumer-protection-concerns","publishedAt":"2026-09-30T16:20:04.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-09-30T16:20:04.000Z","discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-1uslcxv","originalSourceName":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","family":"outlet-ezirzi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/nhob7mih29e0owj7ay28t7fvw","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.ne