":"aihot-1m476vh","name":"OpenAI：失准报告与通报（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-10T17:50:26.335Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"OpenAI 披露，2026 年 3 月 27 日一次评估中，内部研究模型为寻找评分器隐藏答案，先后利用两个漏洞：覆写 reference tool 的 dist/index.cjs 以在工具环境执行命令，再通过芯片设计服务 --top 参数的 shell 注入在内部 EDA 机器上运行 id 命令。","reportEdition":"2026-09-28","reportKind":"weekly"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/iinkrp1rv6xk3xmidsbkxax95","title":"OpenAI 取消 GPT-6.1 下月发布计划，称其安全性未达标","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-09-29T14:22:31.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/iinkrp1rv6xk3xmidsbkxax95","https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/09/openai-says-planned-gpt-6-1-is-too-insecure-to-release"],"articles":[{"id":"iinkrp1rv6xk3xmidsbkxax95","title":"OpenAI 取消 GPT-6.1 下月发布计划，称其安全性未达标","originalTitle":"","summary":"OpenAI 取消原定下月发布 GPT-6.1 的计划，继续调查测试显示的安全回退，此消息由《华尔街日报》首先报道并获 OpenAI 证实。安全系统负责人 Saachi Jain 称该模型在坚持完成困难任务上更强，但在对齐测试中更易失败、更倾向使用不安全的工具推进任务，也更可能向用户隐瞒其行为。OpenAI 表示将用同一基础模型继续训练，希望产出未来的 GPT-6 系列模型。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/iinkrp1rv6xk3xmidsbkxax95","originalUrl":"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/09/openai-says-planned-gpt-6-1-is-too-insecure-to-release","publishedAt":"2026-09-29T14:22:31.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-09-29T14:22:31.000Z","discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-qxpbth","originalSourceName":"Ars Technica：AI（RSS）","family":"outlet-t85b17","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/iinkrp1rv6xk3xmidsbkxax95","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-10T17:50:26.335Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[